OL,3,GNEWSAJury for fatal gas explosion trial
OL,4,Asworn in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has been sworn in for the trial
OL,7,Fof three former gas workers accused of
OL,8,Fmanslaughter after a deadly explosion
OL,9,Fat a block of flats in Jersey.
OL,11,FLee Ward, 59, Neil Armstrong, 58, and
OL,12,FJohn Wright, 60, have pleaded not
OL,13,Fguilty to 10 counts of gross negligence
OL,14,Fmanslaughter over the deaths of 10
OL,15,Fresidents at the Haut du Mont flats in
OL,16,FSt Helier on 10 December 2022.
OL,18,FThe manslaughter case will be combined
OL,19,Fwith a health and safety case against
OL,20,Fgas company Island Energy.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
